{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_88_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_88","textTraditional":"一、二十有五年，春王正月丙午，衞侯燬滅邢。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_88_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_88","textTraditional":"衞侯燬，何以名？絕。曷為絕之？滅同姓也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_88_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_88","textTraditional":"二、夏四月癸酉，衞侯毀卒。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_88_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_88","textTraditional":"三、宋蕩伯姬來逆婦。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_88_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_88","textTraditional":"宋蕩伯姬者何？蕩氏之母也。其言來逆婦何？兄弟辭也。其稱婦何？有姑之辭也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_88_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_88","textTraditional":"四、宋殺其大夫。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_88_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_88","textTraditional":"何以不名？宋三世無大夫，三世內娶也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_88_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_88","textTraditional":"五、秋，楚人圍陳，納頓子于頓。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_88_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_88","textTraditional":"何以不言遂？兩之也。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_88_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_88","textTraditional":"六、葬衞文公。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_88_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_88","textTraditional":"七、冬十有二月癸亥，公會衞子、莒慶，盟于洮。","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}